  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:300px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-gold pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Absorbent Defense</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/ff/PM_Car_Sponge_ST.gif/revision/latest?cb=20211004232638\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"PM Car Sponge ST\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/ff/PM_Car_Sponge_ST.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20211004232638\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/ff/PM_Car_Sponge_ST.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20211004232638 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/ff/PM_Car_Sponge_ST.gif/revision/latest?cb=20211004232638 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"PM Car Sponge ST\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"PM_Car_Sponge_ST.gif\" data-image-name=\"PM Car Sponge ST.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Paper Mario (Paper Mario: Sticker Star) using the 'Car Sponge Thing Sticker'</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Use sponges to defend oneself.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The ability to <b>use sponges to defend oneself.</b> Technique of <a href=\"/wiki/Sponge_Manipulation\" title=\"Sponge Manipulation\">Sponge Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Defense_Powers\" title=\"Defense Powers\">Defense Powers</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorbent_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Absorbent Defensiveness</li>\n<li>Sponge Defense/Defensiveness</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorbent_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user possesses defensive skills that are enhanced by sponge-based powers, allowing them to block, parry, dodge, etc., with the power of a sponge.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorbent_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Defense\">Enhanced Defense</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Exoskeleton\" title=\"Exoskeleton\">Exoskeleton</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Infusion\" title=\"Infusion\">Infusion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Construction\" title=\"Shield Construction\">Shield Construction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wall_Generation\" title=\"Wall Generation\">Wall Generation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorbent_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbent_Creation\" title=\"Absorbent Creation\">Absorbent Creation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Defense_Powers\" title=\"Defense Powers\">Defense Powers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Combat/Enhanced\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Peak Human Combat/Enhanced\">Enhanced Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Power Augmentation\">Power Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sponge_Manipulation\" title=\"Sponge Manipulation\">Sponge Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Water_Manipulation\" title=\"Water Manipulation\">Water Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Water_Mimicry\" title=\"Water Mimicry\">Water Mimicry</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorbent_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May require outside source of tape to make defensive maneuvers.</li>\n<li>Users will be exhausted when too much energy is used.</li>\n<li>May be over-charged/wounded if too much energy is used at once.</li>\n<li>Can only be used for defensive purposes.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorbent_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Paper Mario (<i>Paper Mario: Sticker Star</i>) via the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.mariowiki.com/Car_Sponge\">Car Sponge Sticker</a></li>\n<li>SquarePants Family (<i>SpongeBob SquarePants</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorbent_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"af8bca804ec145a8ff00389f7d893a91\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:141px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Spongebob_Impact-gif\" style=\"position: relative; height:139px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Spongebob_Impact.gif\" title=\"Spongebob Impact.gif (9.15 MB)\" style=\"height:139px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/e0/Spongebob_Impact.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251125200502\" title=\"Spongebob Impact.gif (9.15 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"SpongeBob SquarePants (SpongeBob SquarePants) absorbing the impacts of Flats&#039; punches.\" height=\"139\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Spongebob Impact.gif\" data-image-key=\"Spongebob_Impact.gif\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sp